                "description": "The Inge Oil Rubbed Bronze 24 Inch Door Pull is made from stainless steel. The Oil rubbed bronze finish is very dark brown.  Choose from back to back, thru-bolt, and surface mounting. The Oil Rubbed Bronze Inge Offset 24 Inch Door Handle has 24 inch mounting centers and a 25-1/4 inch overall length.",
